// Transformations: joins, mapping & crosstables — Qlik Sense Data Architect (QSDA 2024)
// Goal: Shape messy source data into an analytics-ready model.
// Concepts: JOIN vs CONCATENATE vs KEEP, ApplyMap (mapping load), Preceding load, Crosstable/Generic load, Subfield/IntervalMatch
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

